Controls:
- Horizontal wheel: 120 logical pixels per normalized unit, eased; 130 ms idle gap ends the sequence. Positive Avalonia delta moves toward newer notes; actual physical direction needs user acceptance. Fractional input is accepted mathematically, not hardware-tested.
- Blue `DRAG NOTES HERE` strip: left-button drag with pointer capture and real release; a short slow drag springs back. Editor mouse selection is kept separate.
