Autosave/relaunch passed through two separate app processes: the first edited and saved an isolated note, and the second restored the saved marker.

The reopen self-check also passed: same editor, focus restored and one initialization. This run measured 3.19 ms for hide dispatch and 3.2 ms from show request to reported focus. The hotkey is currently occupied by another running copy, so the new build correctly displays “hotkey unavailable”; the retest instructions will start by closing the older copy.


